# Permanent NODE_OPTIONS for every `npm run` script in this repo.
# npm exports `node-options` as NODE_OPTIONS to script processes, so this works
# on Windows (PowerShell), macOS and the VPS alike — no cross-env dependency and
# no per-shell setup that gets lost between sessions.
#
# next build on this repo is memory-hungry (10 sport portals + heavy pages) and
# fails with "JavaScript heap out of memory" on the default V8 heap.
node-options=--max-old-space-size=4096
